-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Benchmark model (not redistributed, downloaded by models/fetch_astlingen.py)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Astlingen RTC benchmark, SWMM implementation
https://github.com/open-toolbox/SWMM-Astlingen (commit e226b03)
Model developed by Congcong Sun (IRI, CSIC-UPC) under the supervision of
Manfred Schütze (ifak), Morten Borup and Luca Vezzaro (DTU), as stated in the
repository description, which asks users to quote and mention the authors
when the model is used or disseminated. The repository has no license file.
Reference publication:
  Sun, C.; Svensen, J.L.; Borup, M.; Puig, V.; Cembrano, G.; Vezzaro, L.
  "An MPC-Enabled SWMM Implementation of the Astlingen RTC Benchmarking
  Network." Water 2020, 12(4), 1034. https://doi.org/10.3390/w12041034
Original benchmark: Schütze, M. et al. "Astlingen: a benchmark for real time
control (RTC)." Water Science & Technology, 2017.

